{"text": "At some point in life you stop asking, why did this happen to me? And you start to see that it happened for you.\n\nMaybe the pain was not punishment. Maybe it was preparation. The heartbreak that shattered you taught you how to love without losing yourself. And the people who walked away were never meant to walk your whole path.\n\nWe spend years looking for peace in other people, in success, in control. It is not kept there. Peace begins when you stop arguing with your life.\n\nLife does not punish you, my friend. It redirects you. It clears away what blocks the path, so you can meet the version of yourself buried under all the noise. If you feel lost tonight, you are not behind. You are being aligned. You are not broken. You are becoming.\n\nIf you stayed with me until here, write the word aligned below, and follow me for the rest.\n\nBut you cannot hear that redirection while the mind is still loud. Everything I know is inside The Quiet Between Thoughts. The link is in my profile.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "t", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", " ", "p", "o", "i", "n", "t", " ", "i", "n", " ", "l", "i", "f", "e", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "s", "t", "o", "p", " ", "a", "s", "k", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "w", "h", "y", " ", "d", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", " ", "h", "a", "p", "p", "e", "n", " ", "t", "o", " ", "m", "e", "?", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "s", "t", "a", "r", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "e", "e", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "i", "t", " ", "h", "a", "p", "p", "e", "n", "e", "d", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "y", "o", "u", ".", "\n", "\n", "M", "a", "y", "b", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "a", "i", "n", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "p", "u", "n", "i", "s", "h", "m", "e", "n", "t", ".", " ", "M", "a", "y", "b", "e", " ", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "p", "r", "e", "p", "a", "r", "a", "t", "i", "o", "n", ".", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "h", "e", "a", "r", "t", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "h